  "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/video-and-image-search-in-amazon-bedrock-knowledge-base-using-marengo-3-0/",
  "sourceTitle": "Video and image search in Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Base using Marengo 3.0",
  "sourceBodyHash": "32b3a86c7db4979c300d77bfe12847b9518268380c143fd7a051f90da1913da1",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "groq",
  "requestedModel": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-11T06:07:31.127384Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T21:06:21.205873Z",
  "totalBlocks": 62,
  "translatedBlocks": 62,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c14e97f202ca1b4",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们宣布 TwelveLabs Marengo Embed 3.0 作为嵌入模型在 Amazon Bedrock 知识库中正式可用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7a7d09201e282fd",
      "translationZh": "视频和媒体资产在语义层面仍然基本无法被搜索。媒体、体育分析、教育、安全和零售领域的团队需要使用自然语言在数小时的素材中查找特定时刻。一个示例查询是“给我看下半场的点球”。如今，要在视频上构建语义搜索，需要将转录服务、帧提取流水线、嵌入模型、向量数据库和同步逻辑等复杂组件拼接在一起。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdc7af7c9bd2587c",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 是一项完全托管的检索增强生成（RAG）服务，负责处理存储、摄取、嵌入、重排序和检索。它支持视频文件（MP4、MOV）、图像（JPEG、PNG）和音频轨道，并原生支持 Amazon Simple Storage Service（Amazon S3）、SharePoint、Confluence 等连接器。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5e7ebbdccf5e050",
      "translationZh": "Marengo Embed 3.0 是一个多模态嵌入模型，它将视频、音频、图像和文本共同编码到一个紧凑且存储高效的 512 维向量空间中。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed094d6d1dc3811d",
      "translationZh": "随着 Marengo Embed 3.0 作为嵌入模型选项的推出，通过视频、音频和图像内容进行自然语言搜索已成为一种完全托管的体验。托管知识库（Managed MKB）会自动生成多模态嵌入，将视觉、文本、语音和音频信号捕获到统一的向量表示中。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf2725291931e3b3",
      "translationZh": "本教程演示如何使用 Amazon Bedrock 控制台创建由 Marengo 3.0 驱动的知识库（KB）。该场景包含一段 2022 年国际足联世界杯决赛的 10 分钟视频片段。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1eb43f5118f875dd",
      "translationZh": "我们摄取视频，并针对其运行自然语言查询。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "493fe154c5de78af",
      "translationZh": "一个处于活动状态的 AWS 账户。如果您没有，请参阅“创建 AWS 账户”。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb200582cb46e515",
      "translationZh": "在受支持的区域内，访问已启用 TwelveLabs Marengo Embed 3.0 的 Amazon Bedrock。有关详细信息，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 文档中的“模型访问”。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bbe3876d71b61f6b",
      "translationZh": "一个用于存储视频和图片文件的 Amazon S3 存储桶。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e5bc48fc843c9f61",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 和 Amazon S3 的 AWS 身份和访问管理 (IAM) 权限。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3f21504ca9eee54e",
      "translationZh": "1. 准备您的媒体资产",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "680d46c7c9f36df1",
      "translationZh": "首先，将视频文件上传到 Amazon S3 存储桶。无需进行预处理，因为托管式 MKB 会在内部处理分段、帧采样和转录。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84a273024099674c",
      "translationZh": "图 1：包含用于知识库摄取的已上传足球视频文件的 Amazon S3 存储桶",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5deb94442951a3a9",
      "translationZh": "2. 创建托管式知识库",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cb4115aa4e23c13",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Bedrock 控制台中，导航至 Knowledge Bases 并选择 Create Managed KB。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bcaa51600e607da",
      "translationZh": "图 2：带有 Create managed KB 按钮的 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 控制台",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ceb204f314266797",
      "translationZh": "展开 Additional Configuration 面板，并在 Embeddings model 中选择 Amazon Bedrock embeddings model。默认选择的是 Amazon Titan Text。点击铅笔图标以编辑模型选择。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38efff6e4e3e976b",
      "translationZh": "图 3：显示 KB 名称、服务角色和嵌入模型配置的知识库创建表单",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a26412c614aaa572",
      "translationZh": "如后续图示所示，选择 TwelveLabs/Marengo Embed 3.0。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a60897208c871662",
      "translationZh": "图 4：已选择 TwelveLabs Marengo Embed 3.0 作为嵌入模型的模型选择对话框",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "792a448208b72db6",
      "translationZh": "接下来，展开数据源面板，选择 Amazon S3 作为数据源类型，并配置包含视频资产的存储桶的 S3 URI。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27493081742f12d7",
      "translationZh": "图 5：已选择 Amazon S3 并指定了 S3 URI 的数据源配置面板",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd4b02631e2d08eb",
      "translationZh": "在高级配置下的音频/视频分段配置部分，您可以配置音频和视频的分段时长。两种模态的默认值均为 4 秒。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "507b5297f67d5f72",
      "translationZh": "图 6：包括音频和视频分段设置在内的高级配置选项",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b6abdec4677e036",
      "translationZh": "保持高级参数不变，并选择页面右下角的创建知识库",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8811cc069653aa52",
      "translationZh": "3. 同步并摄取您的数据",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2489d3da5050060",
      "translationZh": "知识库创建后，选择同步以开始摄取。托管式 MKB 会自动提取帧、转录音频、为每个分段生成 Marengo Embed 3.0 嵌入，并将向量写入索引。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd7c5636a5dab687",
      "translationZh": "图 7：显示已完成数据摄取作业的同步历史面板",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d08d62b1d2b63f55",
      "translationZh": "4. 运行语义搜索",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4aa33908900723ee",
      "translationZh": "您可以使用测试功能在不离开控制台的情况下测试您的知识库。配置要检索的源分块数量，应用元数据过滤器，并运行查询，例如“向我展示这场足球比赛中的点球。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35c478d2fcf71741",
      "translationZh": "响应会返回带有元数据的排序结果，包括分块开始时间、分块结束时间、源 URI 和嵌入类型，因此您可以根据需要提取相关部分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "182c26b96736c941",
      "translationZh": "在本示例中，排名靠前的结果识别出了尝试点球的时刻。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a2896145ee5a22f",
      "translationZh": "图 8：知识库测试界面，显示带有视频回放和源分块时间轴的语义搜索结果",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2048ae5deefe2bad",
      "translationZh": "要清理您的资源，请完成以下步骤：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "265c852df724a047",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Bedrock 控制台上，选择 Knowledge Bases 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "170ed296fdb1dba4",
      "translationZh": "选择您的知识库，并记录 IAM 服务角色名称以及 S3 向量索引的 Amazon 资源名称 (ARN)。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17815feaa5fa8a16",
      "translationZh": "选择“删除”并确认。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "477a176c071b0711",
      "translationZh": "在 IAM 控制台上，找到在创建知识库期间之前创建的角色。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0347409f48aee6a0",
      "translationZh": "选择并删除该角色。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "472e659ca31ae1a8",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon S3 控制台中，找到您的 S3 存储桶。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "941fdd988e7c0b05",
      "translationZh": "选择并删除您为本教程上传的文件。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c7239228defd1a51",
      "translationZh": "与您的应用程序集成",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "145a67dd28258b20",
      "translationZh": "您可以使用 Amazon Bedrock Retrieve API 来驱动下游应用程序。请从“详细信息”页面复制调用代码作为起点。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d4322623cfddaec",
      "translationZh": "图 9：使用 Amazon Bedrock Retrieve API 查询知识库的 Python 代码示例",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fd04efd1f4a7669",
      "translationZh": "以下架构展示了多模态内容如何从 Amazon S3 流经 Managed Knowledge Bases，并利用 Marengo 3.0 进行嵌入和索引。在下游，应用程序通过 Boto SDK 的 Retrieve API 查询知识库，或者将其作为 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 中的 Amazon Bedrock Gateway 目标。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac2ca8af6d10059a",
      "translationZh": "图 10：架构示意图，展示了多模态内容从 Amazon S3 经由 Marengo 3.0 管理的知识库流向下游应用程序的过程",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb4e8af918a6a3ad",
      "translationZh": "随着 Marengo 3.0 在 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 中正式可用，您现在可以通过自然语言搜索来充分挖掘视频、音频和图像资产的全部价值，而无需构建或管理复杂的基础设施。只需指定数据源、同步并搜索即可。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "498d0af3982c3ea9",
      "translationZh": "其商业影响波及多个行业：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "76135fa30463ef7e",
      "translationZh": "体育分析：在整个赛季的录像中查找特定的战术、阵型或球员动作。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16a59c55a407f033",
      "translationZh": "媒体与娱乐：媒体资产管理，通过媒体档案或流媒体服务内容进行语义搜索。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9f80bd80aa4a2bb",
      "translationZh": "安全与安保：在监控摄像头录像中搜索特定事件或活动。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0681971535a47c1f",
      "translationZh": "教育与培训：通过概念而非仅通过关键词来定位讲座片段。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4320f35675fd4d91",
      "translationZh": "零售：搜索产品演示视频以查看功能演示。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dea063f81da8c53f",
      "translationZh": "可用性与定价",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61690ebdae55d24e",
      "translationZh": "Marengo Embed 3.0 的 Amazon Bedrock 托管知识库目前在美国东部（弗吉尼亚北部）AWS 区域（us-east-1）和美国西部（加利福尼亚北部）区域（us-west-1）可用。有关受支持模型和区域的完整列表，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 中的“按 AWS 区域划分的受支持模型”。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e1de36448c0e2ff",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Bedrock 的托管知识库时，您只需为存储和检索的内容付费。使用 Marengo Embed 3.0 生成嵌入向量时，将按照 Amazon Bedrock 标准模型调用费率计费。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
